review:
This is awesome remake of a 2010 third person action adventure set in cool dark fantasy setting. Game heavily inspired and borrowed some ideas from many cult classic games and combined them in an awesome package. Original game was somewhat underrated and overlooked by many, if you one of them I highly recommend check it out.

Pros:
- Cool boss fights;
- Awesome art style;
- Amazing voice acting and soundtrack;
- Responsive controls;
- A Lot of secrets;
- Awesome optimisation;
- Interesting story;

Cons:
- Some bugs;
